{
  "_comment": "Companies whose openings Waypoint pulls straight from their applicant-tracking system. Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby and Workable each publish these endpoints so a company's own jobs can be republished, which is why they are the reliable source — unlike LinkedIn, Indeed, StepStone or Glassdoor, which forbid it. 'token' is the board slug in the careers URL, e.g. boards.greenhouse.io/<token>, jobs.lever.co/<token>, jobs.ashbyhq.com/<token>, apply.workable.com/<token>. Every board listed here was probed and had live postings at the time it was added; a token that later stops resolving is reported by name in the Refresh feeds toast rather than failing the whole fetch. Add your own targets the same way — this is the highest-quality source in the app, because the descriptions and posting dates come from the employer.",
